    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Pipe fittings to extend or terminate pipe runs: couplings, adapters, unions, caps and plugs pipe.</span></td></tr>
  </table><div>
</div><p style="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p><div>

