</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><i>The following discussion and analysis of our
financial condition and results of operations should be read in conjunction with our consolidated financial statements and related notes
