</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">We have <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" format="ixt:fixed-true" name="ecd:InsiderTrdPoliciesProcAdoptedFlag" id="ixv-20094">adopted</ix:nonNumeric> insider trading
