<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">During the fiscal year ended September 30, 2021,
the Company entered into a series of consulting agreements with third-party entity and individuals to develop and implement the following
