accounted for more than&#160;<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c235" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zkin:ConcentrationRiskThresholdPercentage" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-20951">10</ix:nonFraction>% of total accounts payable as of September 30, 2025. For the year ended September 30, 2024, two suppliers
