which a maximum of&#160;<span style="-sec-ix-hidden: hidden-fact-9">600,00</span> shares (<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c253" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zkin:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorizedSharesPriorToSplit" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-20978">4,200,000</ix:nonFraction>&#160;shares prior to split) is authorized to be granted to employees of the Company.
The fair value of the shares issued had an estimated fair value of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c254" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueShareBasedCompensation" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-20979">1,185,150</ix:nonFraction>&#160;which is measured based on their fair market value
