<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">On July 26, 2023, the Company issued a total of&#160;<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c255" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesShareBasedCompensation" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-20980">145,657</ix:nonFraction>
shares (<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c255" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zkin:SharesIssuedSharesPriorToSplit" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-20981">1,019,600</ix:nonFraction>&#160;shares prior to split) to&#160;<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c255" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zkin:NumberOfEmployeesToWhomSharesAreIssued" scale="0" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-20982">12</ix:nonFraction>&#160;employees pursuant to the 2021 Equity Incentive Plan under which a maximum
