<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0.5in; text-align: justify">Deferred income taxes reflect the net effects
of temporary difference between the carrying amounts of assets and liabilities for financial statement purposes and the amounts used for
income tax purposes. The Company had&#160;<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c2" decimals="0" format="ixt:fixed-zero" name="us-gaap:DeferredTaxAssetsNet" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-21060"><ix:nonFraction contextRef="c3" decimals="0" format="ixt:fixed-zero" name="us-gaap:DeferredTaxAssetsNet" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-21061">no</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction>&#160;deferred tax assets as of September 30, 2025 and 2024. The Company evaluated the likelihood
of the realization of deferred tax assets and reduces the carrying amount of the deferred tax assets by a valuation allowance to the extent
it believes a portion will not be realized.</p></ix:nonNumeric><div>

